  "description": "LUYZAI crystallizes in the trigonal crystal system with space group P 32 2 1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H90 N32 Nd6 O21,6(C3 H7 N1 O1),3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 4 O neighbors; Nd5 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd6 (Nd) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.738-4.472 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.83-121.61°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C102H90N32Nd6O21·6(C3H7NO)·3(H2O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 5 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Nd(III).",
